{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1c9116f5-dd7f-804c-b336-301e9a923393",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T12:22:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maria Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:20:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:20:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, um, hold on, let me put this bag down. Hi. I'm calling about trash pickup. They missed us again this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:20:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry to hear that. Can I get the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:20:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 40 Thames Street. Fifth Ward, down toward the, um, the corner there. [pause] Sorry, I had the phone upside down. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:20:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. 40 Thames Street. And you said this is a repeat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:20:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's the second miss in a row. Last week they skipped us and today the barrels are still full at the curb. Everybody else on the block got picked up, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:20:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Was everything out by the usual time? Barrels, not bags?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:20:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Barrels, out the night before. The thing is, there's also a neighbor who keeps dumping trash bags at the corner. Like, not mine, somebody else's. They just leave them by the pole. Maybe that's, I don't know, confusing the truck or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:21:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be. Those loose bags at the corner, I'll put that in the notes too so someone can look at it. Is it household trash or recycling that was missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:21:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Trash. Both times trash. The recycling's fine, they got that [crosstalk] sorry, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:21:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine. I'll log a missed pickup for 40 Thames and send it to the crew supervisor so they can come back. Do you want a call back at the number on this phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:21:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:21:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0183. Leave the barrels out where they are today in case the truck comes back around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:21:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, will do. And the bags at the corner, you'll note that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's in there with the report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:21:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:22:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling. Bye now."
    }
  ],
